{
  "_comment": [
    "Path normalizer vectors (docs/wire-protocol.md, 'Path normalizer'). Go (wire.NormalizePath), Python and Node load this",
    "same file. A segment becomes :id if it is all digits, a UUID, hex of 12+ characters, or nanoid-like (16+ characters of",
    "[A-Za-z0-9_-] containing a digit). The query string and fragment are dropped, at most 8 segments are kept."
  ],
